      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "次级动作的表面与边框。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\" type=\"button\">返回首页</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;padding:11px 18px;font-family:'Inter Variable', 'Noto Sans SC Variable', sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 150ms,background 150ms;border:1px solid var(--border, #bec5d7);background:var(--surface, #ebedf3);color:var(--text, #343b58)}.ds-secondary:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #295fba);outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "图标按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "保留点击面积及可读标签。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"打开链接\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:var(--text, #343b58);cursor:pointer}.ds-icon:hover{background:var(--subtle, #dcdfea)}.ds-icon:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #295fba);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "桌面导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-link",
      "description": "现有四个入口；移动菜单行为由生产组件提供。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"站点导航\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">首页</a><a href=\"/ads/\">广告</a><a href=\"/tags/\">标签云</a><a href=\"/map/\">测评地图</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:'Inter Variable', 'Noto Sans SC Variable', sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}.ds-nav a{position:relative;padding:14px 0;color:var(--muted, #53618a);text-decoration:none}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--text, #343b58);font-weight:650}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--accent, #295fba)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #295fba);outline-offset:5px;}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine) and (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-nav a:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:auto 0 5px;height:1px;background:var(--accent, #295fba);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-nav a:hover:after,.ds-nav a:focus-visible:after{transform:scaleX(1)}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "标签筛选",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag-filter",
      "description": "展示未选与选中状态，按钮保持文字标签。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">国家</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">商家</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}.ds-chips button{font-family:'Inter Variable', 'Noto Sans SC Variable', sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;max-width:100%;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border, #bec5d7);border-radius:9px;background:var(--surface, #ebedf3);color:var(--text, #343b58);cursor:pointer}.ds-chips button:hover{background:var(--subtle, #dcdfea);border-color:var(--accent, #295fba)}.ds-chips button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--accent-soft, #dce4f5);color:var(--accent, #295fba);border-color:var(--accent, #295fba);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent, #295fba)}.ds-chips button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #295fba);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "友情链接行",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "friend-link",
      "description": "自然链接网格中的整行点击区，保持外链提示、触摸高度与键盘焦点。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-friend\" href=\"#friend-preview\"><span class=\"ds-friend-name\">朋友的博客</span><span class=\"ds-friend-arrow\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-friend{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;min-width:0;min-height:48px;padding:10px 0;box-sizing:border-box;color:var(--text,#343b58);font-family:'Inter Variable','Noto Sans SC Variable',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;text-decoration:none}.ds-friend-name{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-friend-arrow{display:inline-flex;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--muted,#53618a)}.ds-friend:hover,.ds-friend:focus-visible{color:var(--accent,#295fba)}.ds-friend:hover .ds-friend-name,.ds-friend:focus-visible .ds-friend-name{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-friend:hover .ds-friend-arrow,.ds-friend:focus-visible .ds-friend-arrow{color:var(--accent,#295fba)}.ds-friend:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#295fba);outline-offset:5px}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine) and (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-friend-arrow svg{transition:transform 140ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-friend:hover svg,.ds-friend:focus-visible svg{transform:translate(2px,-2px)}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "测评类型筛选",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "review-type-filter",
      "description": "三等分单选外观，筛选逻辑复用生产组件。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-types\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"测评类型\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">VPS</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">独立服务器</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-types{box-sizing:border-box;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));width:min(100%,360px);gap:4px;padding:4px;margin-bottom:16px;border:1px solid var(--border, #bec5d7);border-radius:12px;background:var(--subtle, #dcdfea)}.ds-types button{min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:8px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted, #53618a);font-family:'Inter Variable', 'Noto Sans SC Variable', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;cursor:pointer}.ds-types button:hover{color:var(--text, #343b58)}.ds-types button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--surface, #ebedf3);color:var(--text, #343b58);font-weight:650;box-shadow:var(--shadow,0 2px 4px rgb(52 59 88 / 4%), 0 12px 36px rgb(52 59 88 / 6%))}.ds-types button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #295fba);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "路由选择器",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "route-picker",
      "description": "仅呈现触发器默认与焦点外观；实际 combobox 的键盘、弹出和选择逻辑在 RouteSelect.astro。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-route\" aria-label=\"选择运营商与城市\"><span>运营商 · 城市</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-route{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;width:100%;min-height:50px;padding:13px 16px;font-family:'Inter Variable', 'Noto Sans SC Variable', sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text, #343b58);background:var(--surface, #ebedf3);border:1px solid var(--border, #bec5d7);border-radius:12px;text-align:left;box-shadow:0 1px 2px #00000004;cursor:pointer}.ds-route span{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-route svg{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--muted, #53618a)}.ds-route:hover{border-color:var(--accent, #295fba)}.ds-route:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #295fba);outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-route{padding:12px 14px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "全球服务器测试手记",
    "overview": "像翻阅熟悉博主的测试手记：语气轻松、亲近，测试证据保持清楚、严谨。头像、国旗和友情链接保留个人博客的温度；页面让读者顺手找到记录，再按需查看数据。\n\n平整、安静的阅读背景是主调。Tokyo 的日光蓝与月光蓝标记链接和选中状态，暮色灰构成表面层级；现有阴影辅助区分卡片与浮层，不把每块内容做成悬浮控件。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "轻松、亲近的博客气质，真实记录优先。",
      "浅深主题共用语义角色，表面明度逐层变化。",
      "信息紧凑，正文、表格和手机布局各自保持可读。",
      "按钮与筛选温和、清楚、顺手；反馈不打断阅读。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Semantic Theme",
        "body": "组件读取语义 CSS 变量；不把浅色值写死进生产组件，深色也不做机械反色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Evidence Alignment",
        "body": "价格、容量、分数、延迟启用等宽数字；文章表头与内容均左对齐。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "Quiet Reading",
        "body": "以表面色差和边框组织内容；列表、标签筛选和说明区保持平整，阴影用于确有层级需求的内容面与浮层。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 使用现有语义色和三档主题切换，切换后保留阅读位置。",
      "Do 让手机内容自然换行，宽表局部滚动，目录按需展开。",
      "Do 保留国旗、真实日期、必要的缺图和空状态，以及清楚的赞助披露。",
      "Do 复用可见焦点、键盘操作和组件的减少动效行为。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t 因“轻松亲近”添加虚构测试、夸张结论或无意义的小字。",
      "Don’t 恢复搜索、展开全部、常驻地图测评侧栏或黑底写实地球。",
      "Don’t 用缩小正文或删除证据的方法压缩手机布局。",
      "Don’t 将首页广告、文章广告和 Sponsors 的不同视觉角色合并成一种展示。"
    ]
  }
}
